  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Applies To:</strong> Two-handed Guns fired with either the Shoulder Arms or Heavy Weapons skill.<br>\n<strong>Cost:</strong> 100eb</p>\n<p>As an Action, the user can deploy the bipod on a surface or on the ground. Once deployed, the weapon can pivot, but the bipod's benefits will be cancelled if it is moved. When the weapon’s bipod is deployed, the weapon has +1 to hit when making an Aimed Shot or when using Autofire and Suppressive Fire.</p>\n<p><strong>Replaces:</strong> Bipod (Corgo's 77 Collection)</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The sheet does not give its slot cost, so it uses 1 (Corgo's Bipod also uses 1).</li>\n<li>The +1 is a toggle in the roll dialog: turn it on for Aimed Shots, Autofire, and Suppressive Fire while the bipod is deployed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From Bontari Homebrew Cyberpunk Items by Bontari (Attachments).</em></p>"
  },
